      "writtenOn": "2023-10-12T00:45:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change basically modifies two things, which are essential to ensure that from-text stub build is compatible with ART branches:\n- Properly handle `static_libs` and `exclude_static_libs` properties in ART branches so that some `java_library` modules that get built in ART branches (e.g. [`core-lambda-stubs`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:libcore/JavaLibrary.bp;drc\u003d59ea0c3b486545395970cc1cc5ab92d524266a3c;l\u003d465)) do not link against from-text stub modules.\n- stub `java_library` modules generated per api scope in `java_sdk_library` to link against the from-source stub `java_library` modules instead of from-text stub `java_api_library`.",
      "parentUuid": "2e0fc156_b04784c2",
      "revId": "15da3cb17cf5aca85243bd9b89fe49fb256c7b84",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
